        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abwira Mose ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Vugana n’Abisirayeli ubabwire uti: ‘Nimwinjira mu gihugu ngiye kubaha, hanyuma mukimbura ivyeze muri co, muze muzanire umuherezi umukama w’ivyeze imbere y’ibindi mu vyo mwimbuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we aze azungagize uwo mukama imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", na wo uzokwemerwa ku bwanyu; uwo muherezi aze awuzungagize ku musi ukurikira Isabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi wo kuzungagiza uwo mukama, muze mutange umwagazi w’intama umaze umwaka kandi utagira agasembwa kw’ikimazi co guturirwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hamwe n’ishikanwa ry’ifu ingana na bibiri vy’icumi vy’ingero efa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ibilo 3,2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " y’ifu inoze neza ivanze n’amavuta; ishikanwa ryo guturirwa rishikaniwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ubumote bwiza; hamwe n’ishikanwa ry’ica kane c’ingero hini",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ilitiro imwe",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " y’umuvinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimuze murye umukate n’umwe, intete zikaranze canke intete nshasha, kugeza kuri uwo musi muzotanga ico kimazi ku Mana yanyu. Iri rize ribe ibwirizwa rihoraho uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikirana n’urundi, aho muzoba muba hose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuva ku musi ukurikira isabato, ari wo musi mwazanyeko wa mukama w’ishikanwa ryo kuzunguza, muze muharure amayinga indwi yuzuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muze muharure imisi mirongo itanu kugeza ku musi ukurikira Isabato igira indwi, hanyuma muce mutanga ishikanwa ry’ifu nshasha k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuva aho muba hose, muze muzane imikate ibiri, umwe wose ukozwe muri bibiri vya cumi vy’ingero efa y’ifu inoze neza, kandi ikaranze irimwo n’umwambiro, nk’ishikanwa ryo kuzungagiza ry’ivyeze imbere y’ibindi rishikaniwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muze mutange uwo mukate hamwe n’impfizi z’intama indwi zikiri imyagazi, umwagazi wose uzobe umaze umwaka kandi utagira agasembwa, n’ishuri ikiri nto n’impfizi zibiri z’intama; ivyo bibe ibimazi vyo guturirirwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ishikanwa ritanzwe hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ifu n’amashikanwa y’ibinyobwa bijanye, ari ryo shikanwa riturirwa rikaba ubumote bwiza buhimbara ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma muze mushikane isuguru y’impene, ibe ikimazi c’ivyaha, hamwe n’imyagazi y’intama ibiri, imaze umwaka, ibe ikimazi c’ishimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuherezi aze azungagize iyo myagazi ibiri imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nk’ishikanwa ryo kuzungagiza, hamwe na wa mukate ukozwe mu vyimburwa vyeze imbere y’ibindi. Bizoba ari ishikanwa ryera k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi rizoba ari iry’umuherezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri uwo musi nyene, muze mutangaze ikoraniro ryera kandi ntihaze hagire igikorwa na kimwe mukora. Iryo rize ribe itegeko rihoraho uko urunganwe ruzokurikirana n’urundi, aho muzoba muba hose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
