          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Barira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Umusi wa mbere w’ukwezi kw’indwi muze muwuruhukeko, ribe ikoraniro ryera muhimbarisha kuvuza inzamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.24",
