          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero kuva ku musi ugira icumi na gatanu w’ukwezi kw’indwi, mumaze kwimbura ivyimburwa vyo mu gihugu, muze muhimbaze umusi mukuru w’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " uzomara imisi indwi; umusi wa mbere uzoba ari uwo kuruhuka, n’umusi w’umunani na wo nyene ni uwo kuruhuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi wa mbere muze muzane ibirusha ibindi kuba vyiza mu vyamye ku biti, amashami y’ibigazi, amashami y’ibiti vy’amababi maninimanini n’ibiti bimera i ruhande y’amazi atemba, hanyuma munezererwe imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu kumara imisi indwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muze muwuhimbaze nk’umusi mukuru w’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " uzomara imisi indwi uko umwaka utashe. Iri rize ribe itegeko rihoraho uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikirana n’urundi; muze muwuhimbaze mu kwezi kw’indwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muze mube mu nsago kumara imisi indwi: Abisirayeli bose b’imvukira baze babe mu nsago ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo abana banyu baze bamenye ko jewe natumye Abisirayeli baba mu nsago igihe nabakura mu gihugu ca Egiputa. Ndi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
